						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5279</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Safe</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5279-1 is placed on a 4 meter high slab of concrete and kept there for 24 hours a day, 4 days a week with exceptions of testing from Level 2 and above research personnel whenever that might occur. It’s also noted that any persons that come into contact with SCP-5279-1 and SCP-5279-2 shouldn’t be wearing green, black, or anything shiny like a ring as wearing such could effect standard testing procedure.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5279-1 is a small seemingly indestructible cardboard box that houses SCP-5279-2, testing shows it’s resistant to fire, gunfire, blunt force, high caliber explosions, and even being doused in lava. Besides SCP-5279-1’s inability to be destroyed or even damaged, the box appears to have no other unusual effects and simply acts as a casing for SCP-5279-2.</p> <p>SCP-5279-2 is a small black spherical rubber ball with the logo “Coca-Cola” branded on the front, upon research of the ball it was discovered that the company Coca-Cola had never actually made a rubber ball product before and that it was hand crafted.</p> <p>SCP-5279-2 can be destroyed and damaged, however 24 hours after it’s originally damaged will seemingly regenerate in SCP-5279-1 even if totally obliterated.</p> <p>While SCP-5279-2 is black in a dormant state, it will start flashing the colors of the rainbow once something black, green, or shiny enters 2 feet within the radius of SCP-5279-2 or SCP-5279-1, this will now be referenced as a “trigger event”.</p> <p>Exactly 3 minutes and 47 seconds after a trigger event occurs 1-2 people within a mile radius of SCP-5279-2 will instantly die of either heart attack or extreme malnutrition, then SCP-5279-2 will revert back to a black color.</p> <p>If there are no persons present after 3 minutes and 47 seconds into the trigger event, then SCP-5279-2 will go back to a dormant state and revert back to being black.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/viralpepsi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7184083&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511799" alt="Viralpepsi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7184083)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/viralpepsi" >Viralpepsi</a></span></p> 
