ody"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5109">SCP-5109: The One-Time Password</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" >HarryBlank</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>SCP-5109 must not be spoken. This restriction is waived in the event of an imminent threat to the life of its keeper&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/canon-renaissance-contest">CanonCon Prize Feature</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel left-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Reviewers' Spotlight: TheAlienBaby</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4333">SCP-4333: The Profligate</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cadavercommander" >CadaverCommander</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>SCP-4333's behavior is distinguished by its primary anomalous property, which allows it to spontaneously manifest currency.</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reviewers-spotlight-archive">Reviewers' Spotlight Archive</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel right-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Reviewers' Spotlight: cybersqyd</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/penny-for-your-thoughts">Penny for Your Thoughts?</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces-alces" >Alces_alces</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>&quot;Heads I tell them, tails I don't.&quot;</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reviewers-spotlight-archive">Reviewers' Spotlight Archive</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <div class="news-block content-panel"> <di