&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h2&quot;&gt;L.S.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h2&quot;&gt;Forgive me for doubting you. Your recruitment of &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/hopping-through-worlds&quot;&gt;Agent Hopper&lt;/a&gt; has been a great boon to the Library and ourselves. And it&#039;s thanks in no small part to their unique talent, variable as it is.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h2&quot;&gt;Their continued findings in this &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/broken-masquerade-hub&quot;&gt;unmasqued branch&lt;/a&gt; of The Tree have been very eye-opening. I&#039;ve taken the liberty of compiling them in one of our extra-universal documentation indices, attached below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
